\textcolor{red}{Let $ \cos (\alpha_i[n]) $ denote the cosine function of the departure angle $\alpha_i[n]$ from the UAV to ground user $i$ at the $n$-th time slot. The corresponding distance between them is $
d_{u, i}[n] = \sqrt{(x_i - x_u[n])^2 + (y_i - y_u[n])^2 + H^2}$. Accordingly, the cosine function of the departure angle can be re-expressed as
