Figure~\ref{fig:cfm-example} shows a CFM $\CFM$ over $\Procs = \{p, q\}$ that is equivalent to the HMSC
$\HMSC$ from Figure~\ref{fig:hmsc-example}, i.e., $L(\CFM) = L(\HMSC)$.
\end{example}

