 The tangent space $T_A \mathcal{V}_r$ to a point $A \in \mathcal{V}_r$ is a complex vector space of dimension $n^2 - (n-r)^2=2nr - r^2$, which we view as a vector subspace $\CC^{n\times n}$. 
