We consider an attacker who aims to inject backdoors into a PTM $f_\theta$ in a data-free manner so that a downstream classifier $g$ built on the backdoored PTM $f_{\theta_b}$ renders the RF fingerprinting system ineffective with attacker-chosen triggers $\mathbf{t}_j \in T$. The attacker has three goals to achieve:

