Define the following
\begin{align*}
A &= -[(1-\alpha)S_0(I-S_0)^{-1} + \alpha S_1(I-S_1)^{-1}],
\\
b&= (1-\alpha)(I-S_0)^{-1}C_{*}^{-1/2}(m_0 - m_{*}) + \alpha(I-S_1)^{-1}C_{*}^{-1/2}(m_1 - m_{*}).
