Define $S_{\alpha} \in \Tr(\Hcal)$ by
\begin{align*}
	&S_{\alpha}(I-S_{\alpha})^{-1} = (1-\alpha)S_0(I-S_0)^{-1} + \alpha S_1(I-S_1)^{-1}\\
	&\equivalent (I-S_{\alpha})^{-1} - I = (1-\alpha)[(I-S_0)^{-1}-I] + \alpha [(I-S_1)^{-1}-I]\\
	&\equivalent (I-S_{\alpha})^{-1} = (1-\alpha)(I-S_0)^{-1} + \alpha (I-S_1)^{-1}
