The results of training our networks using this coding-level-dependent inhibition scheme are shown in \figurename~\ref{hammingdist_dyninhibit} and \ref{learnedSynMatrixDynInhib}. As expected, we see that class 1 is now represented in the learned synaptic matrix similarly to what happens to class 0.

