\section{PARD Framework}

We begin by introducing how the PARD model predicts multiple tokens in a single forward pass and provide a detailed explanation of its inference process in Section~\ref{sec:pardinfer}. Next in Section~\ref{sec:pardtrain}, we describe how to finetune a vanilla draft model to acquire the capabilities of PARD. Moreover, we propose a conditional drop training token method that significantly accelerates training. 

