    \caption{Permutation scheme applied on a symmetric, positive-definite, matrix in order to perform its parallel factorization and selected-inversion. The matrix is distributed amongst three processes and permuted accordingly. The permutation-induced fill-in during the decomposition is shown in red hatches in the permuted matrix.}
