\paragraph{User Study.}
We conducted a user study on 50 images from DragBench and VFD-Bench, comparing FlowDrag with DiffEditor, FreeDrag, and GoodDrag. We recruited 25 volunteers to rank each method's edited results (4 = best, 1 = worst) based on drag accuracy and image quality. As shown in Fig. \ref{fig:fig7}, FlowDrag consistently received higher scores than the other methods in both aspects.

