\begin{enumerate}[label=(\roman*)]
    \item \textbf{Long context still matters, but architecture matters more:}  
        Our CodeT5-Authorship model once again leads the results, followed closely by Longformer (12 layers, 2,048-token window), which achieves 95.0\% accuracy.

