    \item \textbf{Sheer LLM parameter size is not what matters:}  
          Several models, even including the simple base BERT model beats QWEN2-1.5B (1.5 B parameters), showing that capturing high-level style cues, and fine-tuning efficiency matter more than long-range generation ability.

