In summary, over the past decades, advancements in artificial intelligence have significantly impacted the field of 3D reconstruction in radiological imaging, leading to a variety of innovative approaches. The developmental roadmap is shown in Fig.\ref{fig:0}. Thus, it is essential to summarize existing research and conduct a comprehensive comparison and analysis of methods in this field, providing a reference for future studies.
