\hline
Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE) $\downarrow$ & \( RMSE = \sqrt{MSE} \) & Square root of MSE. \\
\hline
Normalized Root Mean Square Error (NRMSE) $\downarrow$ & \( NRMSE = \frac{\sqrt{MSE}}{\max(x) - \min(x)} \) & Normalized MSE for different intensity ranges.  \\
\hline
